      <VERS vnumber="8"> O <gr str="1288">bless </gr>our <gr str="430">God</gr>, ye <gr str="5971">people</gr>, and make the <gr str="6963">voice </gr>of his <gr str="8416">praise </gr>to be <gr str="8085">heard</gr>: </VERS>
